(LOCALIQ Test Knowledge Document - Page 1) '
() '
(LOCALIQ Architecture & System Definition:) '
(LOCALIQ is an air-gapped, privacy-first on-device knowledge assistant designed to index personal and enterprise documents, extract text locally using Mozilla PDF.js, and answer questions grounded strictly in local knowledge without leaking data or telemetry to third-party cloud servers.) '
() '
(Core Capabilities:) '
(1. Zero-cloud document indexing) '
(2. Privacy-enforced air-gapped knowledge vault) '
(3. Local ONNX neural inference) '
(4. Grounded RAG answer generation) '
ET
endstream
