(LOCALIQ Test Knowledge Document - Page 3) '
() '
(Local Semantic Search & Retrieval Pipeline:) '
(LOCALIQ performs semantic search by executing on-device mathematical inner product cosine similarity comparisons against indexed 384-dimensional vectors.) '
(When a user submits a query, LOCALIQ embeds the query with the local all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model, calculates cosine similarity against every stored chunk vector, filters candidates by a similarity threshold of 0.35, and ranks the matching chunks in descending order.) '
(Every retrieved chunk maintains strict provenance including file name, page number, and chunk index for verifiable citation.) '
ET
endstream
